        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395310/extras/bf6416478bcc04c326f6b09e1412bb67.avif?t=1759162237\" alt=\"Gunpoint Gambit poster\" width=1560 height=1092 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a multiplayer battleground where history’s boldest factions collide – from daring pirates and sharpshooting cowboys to mysterious warriors and adventurers yet to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is fast, tactical, and unpredictable. Master gunplay, outmaneuver rivals, and call upon loyal companions to sniff out loot, scout enemies, and shift the balance of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395310/extras/b3285792e06e2f6f3834130b9b971c9b.avif?t=1759162237\" alt=\"Gunpoint Gambit weapons\" width=1342 height=939 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steel, Powder, and Precision</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the humble crack of a weathered blunderbuss to the thundering roar of a well-aimed grenade launcher, every weapon in <i>Gunpoint Gambit</i> is forged with an adventurer’s touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the battlefield for chests and supplies, trade up your firepower, and be ready for anything the fight throws at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future updates may also bring new weapons into the mix, offering fresh ways to outwit your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395310/extras/8866bcda45876abbb16a517b861800a5.avif?t=1759162237\" alt=\"Gunpoint Gambit skins\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395310/extras_big/8866bcda45876abbb16a517b861800a5.webp?t=1759162237 width=1560 height=1092 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Faces of Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is alive with rivalries – pirates clashing with cowboys, each brandishing their own swagger. Yet this is only the opening chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the updates to come, new warriors from distant lands and forgotten tales will step into the fray, bringing fresh looks, fresh legends, and new ways to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• </strong>Unlock every skin just by playing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• </strong>New factions coming in free content updates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• </strong>Additional maps are planned to expand the arenas where battles unfold</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395310/extras/22c1540d755df58148b3591546f8cda8.avif?t=1759162237\" alt=\"Gunpoint Gambit pets\" width=1560 height=1092 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Allies with Paws and Claws</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your companions aren’t just for show – they’re a vital part of your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Dogs</strong> — sniff out hidden loot, alert you to nearby enemies, and distract opponents at the right moment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Parrots</strong> — scout from the skies, spot enemy locations, and help control the flow of battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• More to come</strong> — future updates may bring new animal companions with unique abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395310/extras/c0ac48d314e67398d7a0d546a236839a.avif?t=1759162237\" alt=\"Gunpoint Gambit coin\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395310/extras_big/c0ac48d314e67398d7a0d546a236839a.webp?t=1759162237 width=1560 height=683 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Captain’s Promise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-time purchase. No pay-to-win.</strong> Everything in the game can be unlocked simply by playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who prefer to skip the grind, optional cosmetic unlocks may be available in the future – purely visual and never affecting gameplay balance. Whether you choose to earn everything through play or grab a shortcut for style, the battlefield is always fair.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395310/extras/bf6416478bcc04c326f6b09e1412bb67.avif?t=1759162237\" alt=\"Gunpoint Gambit poster\" width=1560 height=1092 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a multiplayer battleground where history’s boldest factions collide – from daring pirates and sharpshooting cowboys to mysterious warriors and adventurers yet to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is fast, tactical, and unpredictable. Master gunplay, outmaneuver rivals, and call upon loyal companions to sniff out loot, scout enemies, and shift the balance of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395310/extras/b3285792e06e2f6f3834130b9b971c9b.avif?t=1759162237\" alt=\"Gunpoint Gambit weapons\" width=1342 height=939 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steel, Powder, and Precision</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the humble crack of a weathered blunderbuss to the thundering roar of a well-aimed grenade launcher, every weapon in <i>Gunpoint Gambit</i> is forged with an adventurer’s touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the battlefield for chests and supplies, trade up your firepower, and be ready for anything the fight throws at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future updates may also bring new weapons into the mix, offering fresh ways to outwit your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395310/extras/8866bcda45876abbb16a517b861800a5.avif?t=1759162237\" alt=\"Gunpoint Gambit skins\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395310/extras_big/8866bcda45876abbb16a517