m/apps/3395310/extras_big/c0ac48d314e67398d7a0d546a236839a.webp?t=1759162237 width=1560 height=683 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Captain’s Promise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-time purchase. No pay-to-win.</strong> Everything in the game can be unlocked simply by playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who prefer to skip the grind, optional cosmetic unlocks may be available in the future – purely visual and never affecting gameplay balance. Whether you choose to earn everything through play or grab a shortcut for style, the battlefield is always fair.</p>",
